cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use PathTrove, please cite it as below and include the access date,
  because the table and reports are updated continuously.
type: dataset
title: "PathTrove: Toward Ready-to-Use Clinical Data Services for Computational Pathology"
authors:
