url: "https://www.pathtrove.cn"
repository: "https://github.com/DearCaat/PathTrove"
abstract: >-
  PathTrove organizes computational pathology data resources, research papers
  and experiment-ready labels. It combines an evidence-backed database of
  resource reports, data-source reports, paper reports, download guides and
  label files with services that turn a clinical research need into
  ready-to-use data.
keywords:
  - computational pathology
  - pathology datasets
  - dataset catalog
  - data provenance
  - data access
